,"width":0.94}]},{"s":"how","shows":{"p":"air","does":"air runs pump to tank to bag, car lifts, then drops"},"do":[{"p":"outAll","v":"hide","w":"The"},{"p":"air","v":"valveLitBack","w":"The"},{"p":"air","v":"pumpAir","w":"compressor"},{"p":"air","v":"compRun","w":"compressor"},{"p":"air","v":"tankAir","w":"fills"},{"p":"air","v":"valveLit","w":"valve"},{"p":"air","v":"raise","w":"lifts","d":1.2},{"p":"air","v":"raiseB","w":"lifts","d":1.2},{"p":"air","v":"raiseBack","w":"drops","d":1.2},{"p":"air","v":"raiseBBack","w":"drops","d":1.2}],"shots":[{"focus":["air.axle","air.valve","air.tank"],"width":0.8}]},{"s":"fact","shows":{"p":"lift","does":"yellow arrows push up on the bag while the gauge shows pressure"},"do":[{"p":"lift","v":"show","w":"lifts"}],"shots":[{"focus":["air.gauge","air.bag","lift"],"width":0.8}]},{"s":"finish","shows":{"p":"air","does":"remote with lamp pops in, a car rolls in"},"do":[{"p":"truck","v":"arrive","d":1.6},{"p":"truck","v":"leave","w":"Add"},{"p":"air","v":"remoteOn","w":"remote"},{"p":"air","v":"remoteLit","w":"light"},{"p":"air","v":"compRun","w":"light"},{"p":"air","v":"compLit","w":"light"},{"p":"final","v":"arrive","w":"rolling","d":1.6,"o":-0.7}],"shots":[{"focus":["air","final"],"width":0.85}]},{"s":"congrats","shows":{"p":"air","does":"calm finished bagged car"},"do":[],"shots":[{"focus":"home"}]}],"roles":["hook","problem","stakes","fix1","problem2","fix2","problem3","fix3","name","name2","how","fact","finish","congrats"]},"sentences":[{"role":"hook","text":"If you swap the steel spring under a car for a rubber bag of air, you have air suspension."},{"role":"problem","text":"But the bag leaks and goes flat, so the car sags down onto its tire."},{"role":"stakes","text":"Now over 4000 pounds of car press down on a flat bag that cannot hold it."},{"role":"fix1","text":"So you add a compressor that pumps air down a hose into the bag, and the car lifts."},{"role":"problem2","text":"But the little pump is slow, so after every dip the car stays low."},{"role":"fix2","text":"So you add a tank that stores pressurized air, and the bag refills in seconds."},{"role":"problem3","text":"But with nothing to stop the air, it rushes in, the bag swells, and the car shoots up too high."},{"role":"fix3","text":"So you add a valve that lets air in or out, and the car settles at the right height."},{"role":"name","text":"This bag is called an air spring."},{"role":"name2","text":"And the bag, pump, tank and valve together are called air suspension."},{"role":"how","text":"The compressor fills the tank, the valve opens, air lifts the car, then the valve lets it drops."},{"role":"fact","text":"The bag at about 100 psi lifts roughly 2800 pounds, though real bags give a bit less."},{"role":"finish","text":"Add a remote with a height button and a pressure light, then park the car rolling in."},{"role":"congrats","text":"Congratulations, you have built a bagged car."}]}